7.	Unlocked Wooden Forest up to level 150, Mist Forest up to level 140, Snow Mountain up to level 130, Buried Temple up to level 110 and Hellish path up to level 95, these include high difficulty version of each map. New materials and items (lv.8+) may also drop in these maps’ high difficulty levels (denoted as 2-star levels in selector)

